      "operative_body": "That Council: 1. Direct staff to proceed with consideration of the following variances for 1345 Ravens View Drive: a. That Section 3.05.02(3)(a)(i) of Zoning Bylaw No. 300 be varied from the required 4.5 m (15ft) or 60% of the height of the residential dwelling to 5.89 m; b. That Section 3.05.02 (4)of Zoning Bylaw No. 300 be varied from the required 30 m2 to 224.19 m2; Subject to the following terms and conditions: i. That the site is developed in accordance with the plan attached to this report as Appendix A.",
